arvel on the TV advert for Team Challenges. A deep powerful voice requested & delivered.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2016-05-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Disney Store Marvel Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>This time I was asked for a powerful read for the Disney Store Marvel Voiceover. Well, it was Disney, so of course, I jumped at the chance. I think it's turned out really nice.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Check out the video</h2>\r\n<p>The Challenge will see kids pick a side, either Team Captain America or Team Iron Man. I know who I'd choose... I love doing anything like this and much of my work seems to revolve around kids games and toys, especially superhero-themed toys, such as <a href=\"/marvel-spiderman-voiceover\" title=\"Spiderman Voiceover\">Spiderman</a> and <a href=\"/marvel-superheroes-voiceover\" title=\"Avengers Voiceover\">Avengers costumes</a>! As a Big fan of Disney and now that my daughter is at an age to appreciate it, I count them as an awesome client to have onboard.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HN6J5H4XpNo","title":"Disney Store Marvel Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/disney-store-marvel-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Disney Store Marvel Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>How it works</h2>\r\n<p><em>The Marvel Team Challenge will give guests the chance to either support Captain America on his quest to remain independent or Iron Man, who wants to support the government in their mission to protect the people.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Disney store guests get to pick their teams and are then taken on a quest to complete four team-building tasks in order to win puzzle pieces.</em></p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you've got a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">promotion</a> you need a voice for? Maybe one like this Disney Store Marvel Voiceover? Please do get in touch. To make the process even easier, just let me know the intended usage of the production and I can quote you more accurately. Feel free to send a short sample of the script and I'd be more than happy to send you a short audition to check if my voice is right for your show or project.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Disney Store Marvel Voiceover","pageUrl":"disney-store-marvel-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","806",{"href":"/voice-over-videos-animals","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/voice-over-videos-animals1.jpg","alt":"Voice Over Videos: Animals","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-relate